	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et vitę innocentiam a patre et domino nostro Iesu Christo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Nisi christianissimus d. <persName ref="p8127">Chuonradus Pellicanus</persName> proximis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nundinis <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiensibus</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Die <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Herbstmesse fand in der Regel zwischen 15. August und 8. September statt; vgl. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl> <ref target="file10925">[Nr. 884]</ref>, S. 406, Anm. 5.</note> ad me litteras plenas pietate et fide <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>misisset<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Der nicht erhaltene Brief, am 31. August 1538 geschrieben, war am 27. Oktober bei <persName ref="p2448">Pergener</persName> eingetroffen, wie aus dem unten Anm. 6 verzeichneten Schreiben hervorgeht.</note>, maxima adfectus essem tristitia; incertus plane fuiss<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>em litteras meas<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><bibl source="b10">HBBW VIII</bibl>, <ref target="file11154">Nr. 1111</ref>.</note> quantumlibet impolitas <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> non pervenis<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>se.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc autem recepi animum atque gaudio suffundor <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tam celebres viros infirmorum quoque fratrum habere rationem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Certi sumus ex omnibus vestris scriptis, quę nobis indicant <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>summam mansuetudinem, pietatem et amorem christianum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et nos vobis curę esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nolo te ignorare, charissime <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><persName ref="p495">Bulingere</persName>, te magnam iniisse gratiam cum illis etiam, qui <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>hostes erant renate evangelistę[!] veritati, eo quod d. <persName ref="p18722">Erasmum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Roterod[amum]</persName> de pietate et litteris bene meritum scribis virum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>immortali laurea dignum; nam ea verba, que sincere de <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>illo scribis li[bro] 2.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">De scripturę sanctę authoritate<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Siehe De scripturae sanctae authoritate <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> (<persName ref="p4851">Froschauer</persName>) 1538 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 111). fol. 83r.</note> etc., ad multos <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>etiam papisticę factionis perscripsi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Laudant et ipsi vestram <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>modestiam ubique in scribendo; multis displicuit, quod a <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nonnullis apellaretur <persName ref="p18207">Lutianus</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p18207">Lukian von Samosata</persName> (als Inbegriff des gottlosen Spötters).</note>, <persName ref="p4714">Epicurus</persName>, scepticus et <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>aliis odiosis nominibus<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vgl. <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName>, De servo arbitrio, <bibl source="b671">WA</bibl> XVIII 605, 27-32; 609, 21f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed tu, sincerissime in Christo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>frater, perge nos, qui longe a vobis sumus dissiti, instit<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>uere tuis sanctissimis scriptis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Dici non potest, quantum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ea scripta, quę ex <placeName ref="l587">Tiguro</placeName>, <placeName ref="l28">Basilea</placeName> vel <placeName ref="l491">Argentorato</placeName> mittuntur, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>pios delectent; testes complures adducere possem.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Reliqua <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ad d. Chuonradum<pb type="edition" next="64"/> <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> scripsi<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Siehe <persName ref="p2448">Pergener</persName> an <persName ref="p8127">Konrad Pellikan</persName>, 21. Februar 1539; Autograph in: Zürich ZB, Ms F 47, 28.</note> et partim <placeName ref="l822">Germanice</placeName><note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> <placeName ref="l822">Germanicae</placeName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ad <persName ref="p4851">Christopherum Froschouerum</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Nicht erhalten.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale semper in Christo <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>cum omnibus tuis simmistis et tota ecclesia.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Orate deum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>pro nobis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l580">Zittę</placeName>, 21. die mensis februarii anno etc. 1539.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><persName ref="p2448">Osvaldus Pergenerus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>tui deditissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Summe pietatis et doctrinę viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bulingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurine</placeName> ecclesię ministro <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fidelissimo, amico et fratri <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>colendissimo<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
